        "original_id": "1754e551-a5c4-5c63-ac73-3566e37be534",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jon Heder, Rob Schneider, David Spade, Patrick Stewart, James Roday, Julianna Guill, Cheryl Hines, Gary Cole, Roy Disney\n- Films and Series: Napoleon Dynamite, The Benchwarmers, School for Scoundrels, Blades of Glory, Mama's Boy, When in Rome, Walt Before Mickey, Monster House, Surf's Up, Christmas Eve\n- Companies: Revolution Studios, Happy Madison Productions, Columbia Pictures\n- Roles: actor, producer, voice actor\n\nFacts:\n- Jon Heder was born on October 26, 1977, and he is an American actor and producer.\n- Jon Heder made his feature film debut in 2004 as the title character in the comedy film Napoleon Dynamite.\n- Jon Heder acted in The Benchwarmers, School for Scoundrels, Blades of Glory, Mama's Boy, When in Rome, and Walt Before Mickey, in which he portrayed Roy Disney.\n- Jon Heder provided voice acting for the animated films Monster House and Surf's Up and for the Napoleon Dynamite animated series.\n- The Benchwarmers stars Rob Schneider, David Spade, and Jon Heder.\n- The Benchwarmers was produced by Revolution Studios and Happy Madison Productions and was distributed by Columbia Pictures.\n- The 2015 film Christmas Eve features an ensemble cast led by Patrick Stewart, James Roday, Julianna Guill, Jon Heder, Cheryl Hines, and Gary Cole.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
